#: data/maps/SootopolisCity_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:178
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_GymGuideAdvice"
msgid ""
"Yo! How's it going, CHAMPION-\n"
"bound {PLAYER}?\p"
"SOOTOPOLIS's GYM LEADER JUAN is\n"
"a master of WATER-type POKéMON.\p"
"And, to get to JUAN, an icy floor\n"
"will hamper your progress…\p"
"Listen, I'm sorry, but that's all the\n"
"advice that I have for you.\p"
"The rest of the way, you have to\n"
"go for it yourself!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:190
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_GymGuidePostVictory"
msgid ""
"Yow! You've beaten even JUAN, who\n"
"was supposedly the best in all HOENN!\p"
"Okay! Check out your TRAINER CARD.\p"
"If you've gotten all the BADGES, you're\n"
"set for the POKéMON LEAGUE challenge!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:197
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_JuanIntro"
msgid ""
"Let me ask you.\n"
"Did you know?\l"
"Ah, I should not be so coy.\p"
"It was I who taught WALLACE everything\n"
"there is to know about POKéMON.\p"
"Once, I had given up my position as\n"
"the GYM LEADER.\p"
"In my place, I had entrusted WALLACE\n"
"with the GYM.\p"
"However, a compelling reason arose for\n"
"me to make a comeback.\p"
"Ah, but enough chatter.\n"
"Let us begin our match, shall we?\p"
"Please, you shall bear witness to\n"
"our artistry.\p"
"A grand illusion of water sculpted\n"
"by POKéMON and myself!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:220
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_JuanDefeat"
msgid ""
"Ahahaha, excellent!\n"
"Very well, you are the winner.\p"
"From you, I sense the brilliant shine\n"
"of skill that will overcome all.\p"
"However, compared with me or even\n"
"WALLACE, you are lacking in elegance.\p"
"Perhaps I should make you a loan\n"
"of my outfit?\p"
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … …\p"
"Hahaha, I merely jest!\p"
"Rather than my clothes, I shall reward\n"
"you with this, the RAIN BADGE!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:235
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_ReceivedRainBadge"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} received the RAIN BADGE\n"
"from JUAN.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:239
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_ExplainRainBadgeTakeThis"
msgid ""
"Having the RAIN BADGE shall assure you\n"
"the full obedience of all your POKéMON\l"
"to your every command.\p"
"The RAIN BADGE also allows the use\n"
"of the HM move WATERFALL to scale\l"
"walls of cascading water.\p"
"And, so that you never forget the\n"
"battle we shared, take this…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:249
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_ExplainWaterPulse"
msgid ""
"The TECHNICAL MACHINE I handed you\n"
"contains WATER PULSE.\p"
"In use, it will occasionally confuse\n"
"the target with ultrasonic waves.\p"
"… … … … … …$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:256
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_RegisteredJuan"
msgid ""
"Registered GYM LEADER JUAN\n"
"in the POKéNAV.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:260
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_JuanPostBattle"
msgid ""
"The TRAINERS who have gathered all\n"
"the GYM BADGES of HOENN should make\l"
"way to the ultimate destination.\p"
"The POKéMON LEAGUE.\p"
"Travel to the easternmost reaches\n"
"of HOENN, to the island EVER GRANDE.\p"
"There, you shall find the POKéMON\n"
"LEAGUE.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:270
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_GoGetFortreeBadge"
msgid ""
"There remains but one BADGE to\n"
"obtain in HOENN.\p"
"If you wish to challenge the POKéMON\n"
"LEAGUE, you must obtain the last\l"
"BADGE from the GYM in FORTREE.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:277
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_GymStatue"
msgid "SOOTOPOLIS CITY POKéMON GYM$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:280
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_GymStatueCertified"
msgid ""
"SOOTOPOLIS CITY POKéMON GYM\p"
"JUAN'S CERTIFIED TRAINERS:\n"
"{PLAYER}$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:285
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_JuanPreRematch"
msgid ""
"JUAN: Ah, this GYM had returned to its\n"
"usual state of serenity…\p"
"But our young typhoon has returned\n"
"to put us to the test again!\p"
"Well, my friend, most certainly!\p"
"I shall be delighted to dance with you\n"
"as often as you wish!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:294
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_JuanRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
"Ahahaha, you are the winner!\n"
"You have defeated me again!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:298
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_JuanPostRematch"
msgid ""
"JUAN: If I told you to become my\n"
"apprentice, you will refuse, I am sure.\p"
"I would like to make a gift of my coat\n"
"to you.\p"
"But again, you will refuse.\n"
"I imagine that to be so.\p"
"And that, my friend, is a certain sign\n"
"of nobility!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity_Gym_1F/scripts.inc:308
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Gym_1F_Text_JuanRematchNeedTwoMons"
msgid ""
"JUAN: Ah, this GYM had returned to its\n"
"usual state of serenity…\p"
"But our young typhoon has returned\n"
"to put us to the test again!\p"
"Well, my friend, most certainly!\n"
"I shall be delighted to dance with you…\p"
"Ah, no, no, no.\n"
"You have with you but one POKéMON.\p"
"I wish that you would return with\n"
"two, perhaps more, POKéMON, please.$"
msgstr ""
